1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Kilder===
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://media.digitalarkivet.no/kb20051209020140 Døpt 11. juni 1871] i Høgsfjord prgj., Forsand sogn - '''Tobias''' (nr. 35).
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://media.digitalarkivet.no/kb20060801080436 Konfirmert 11. oktober 1885] i Høgsfjord prgj., Forsand sogn - '''Tobias Pedersen''' (nr. 5).
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://media.digitalarkivet.no/kb20060801070555 Gift 5. mai 1896] i Sola (Håland) prgj., Madla sogn med Anna Serine Henriksdatter Hofland (nr. 1).
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Tobias Molaug was the eldest son of Peder and Inger Lene Molaug at Stokka/Stavanger.He was married to Anna Hovland from Hogstad in Sola near Stavanger.They had 9 children:Lena, Henrik, Per, Ingvald, Trygve (Ted), Bergit, Einar, Ar
2 CONC ne and Sigmund-  He was a farmer as his father.Lived for a few years at Espedal, hence bought farm at Madla that Henrik (oldest son) took over in 1944 when Tobias died.
2 CONT His sons Trygve (Ted) and Ingvald took to USA (Cal) where they both worked as seamen,Trygve hence constructor of oil-plants (worked internationally) Ingvald sea-captain (Moore Mc Cormack Lines).Einar:Machinist. Per:Postmaster.Sigm
2 CONC und constructor.Arne Policeman.Lena married a widower at Hallingdal,Norway (Ivar Slettemoen)(farmer and local teacher) who had 8 children, and she had 8 children of her own. Bergit Molaug lived her life working for children-care a
2 CONC ll her life.
2 CONT --------------------
