1 NAME Svend /Axelsen/
2 GIVN Svend
2 SURN Axelsen
2 _MARNM Axelsen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 16 AUG 1856
2 PLAC Kristiansand, Vest-Agder, Norway
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1920
2 ADDR
3 CITY Durban
3 STAE KwaZulu-Natal
3 CTRY South Africa
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Barnedåp: 5. sept 1856, Kristiansand: https://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.1.1/N42F-Z8H
2 CONT
2 CONT Svend og Hanne Juel ble gift i Cardiff 6/10 1889: http://digitalarkivet.arkivverket.no/kb/vi/person/pv00000000775542
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.sjohistorie.no/personer/a/svend_axelsen_f_1856 Sjøhistorie.no] sier at Svend var skipsfører på [http://www.sjohistorie.no/skip/a/ararat_aar_1877?distrikt=None briggen "Ararat"] i 1889 og 1895 (2 perioder), og at han og
2 CONC så var landhandler.
2 CONT
2 CONT == About Norwegians in South Africa ==
2 CONT There has been a quite sizeable Norwegian immigration to South Africa, mainly settling in the Durban area. At this time it is not know if Svend settled in South Africa or if he just happened to die there, but the Norwegian settler
2 CONC s in Marburg have their own site: http://www.norsettler.co.za/
2 CONT
2 CONT See also http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norwegian_South_African
